  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Humanitarian Protection Programme (SHPP) OHCHR component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Syria Humanitarian Protection Programme (SHPP) aims to address key protection   challenges in Syria by contributing to both the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) and the Office of the United Nations High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR) Syria appeals. The crisis has created daunting challenges for women and girls, who are paying the steepest price of ongoing hostilities, economic collapse, and climate-related challenges among others.  The SHPP business case was extended by three years.</narrative>
  </description>
